msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Osservo vagamente la folla riunita per il sanguinario banchetto del lord."

#: scenario8:scenario8_BC8D5651_420B_41D0_B8BC_3B80B2882889
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3803a56c2df2e0e6fe5e31c8aaccb02a0b349fcc175270509c0f5860c0113caf
