msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Every time he has guests, he throws another party, and every time, he slices another part of "
"“my” arms or legs open."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ogni volta che ha degli ospiti, organizza un altro ricevimento, e ogni volta, taglia "
"un’altra zona delle “mie” braccia o delle “mie” gambe."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D0DF88BF_F522_48C6_81E2_35FBAA7A0116
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63992615f9cd3e88990269a272fdd4dfd5e17f51a27b211d3aa7b824fb811732
