"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The lord sometimes has trouble deciding where to cut—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but not out of any "
"sense of sympathy for “me”..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A volte il lord ha difficoltà nel decidere dove tagliare—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ma non perché "
"provi compassione per “me”..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_DEFF203E_C636_4EB9_B033_2C4348FC6B86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0136c73cd4d2e527ff72a9210b9de3207987534c7cc659b73330372014230946
