"⟪k:0⟫Stop this... ⟪k:1⟫Can you not comprehend that what you’re doing is an affront to the Lord?!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Smettila... ⟪k:1⟫Non capisci?! Quello che stai facendo è un affronto al Signore!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C80D2072_3166_4C3C_88B9_0C35356C45E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9772eeb515d0d9995106150c31491b142583bf24ed900a81a9e8aec03d20beda
