"⟪k:0⟫Your soul... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫will⟪k:3⟫ be punished...!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You may not see the effects now..."
"⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫but you will pay for your sins one day!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La tua anima... ⟪k:1⟫verrà punita...!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Puoi non vederne gli effetti adesso...⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫ma un giorno pagherai per i tuoi peccati!"

